This product includes software developed as part of the
WarpScoutGUI-AWG project (https://github.com/RVMXL/WarpScoutGUI-AWG):
a desktop GUI for the warpscout CLI utility, built on Neutralino.

Third-party components distributed with the built application
(each under the MIT License; full texts are included in every
release archive):

  * warpscout v0.16.0
    https://github.com/vernette/warpscout  (c) Nikita S.
  * Neutralino core and client, v6.10.0
    https://github.com/neutralinojs/neutralinojs
    (c) Neutralinojs and contributors; the full LICENSE-neutralino.txt
    also covers the C++ libraries bundled inside the Neutralino core
  * QR Code Generator for JavaScript
    https://github.com/kazuhikoarase/qrcode-generator  (c) 2009 Kazuhiko Arase

The AWG protocol support in warpscout is based on amneziawg-go
(MIT, https://github.com/amnezia-vpn/amneziawg-go), which is in turn
based on wireguard-go (MIT, (c) Jason A. Donenfeld).

